message: "If you use this data or code, please cite it as below. The DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22281543 resolves to the latest version; version DOIs are listed on the Zenodo record."
type: software
title: "VI and Thermal Recovery in Landslide Areas: data and code"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and model-ready data for a satellite-scale test of whether land surface
  temperature recovers as fast as greenness after forest disturbance, using Landsat 8/9
  summer composites (2013-2026), Taiwan's official event-based landslide catalogue and
  terrain-matched intact-forest controls. Every statistic can be recomputed from the
  tables in this repository.
